{"id":"5772d8af0b42a75dd17fbae09b4a12eaf43bee082706b93e50b0cfa6efe1dbf2","pubkey":"1ea4ae8405ad5c6bd0dc35a0ac83e548c485142538e1e0c54ad40e5bb59a2ae8","created_at":1782782584,"content":"🪜⬇️lore:\n\nterry lester was cia, a high level russian asset, spoke and read fluent russian. he was also a crypto junky in the 90s and an early cypher punk in the field with steve jobs etc. he was assigned as intelligence debrief at fort huachuca. among other things, he and my mom worked on translating spirit&life .... the connection to the only public s&l book in LA being \"ukrainian\" because they are david yessievich (bulgakov) is an irrelevant misappropriation by, shall we say, hollywood miners .... terry was \"russian\". the french misalignment regarding terry and the long trust has to do with the hollywood interpretation of events - not reality. you can verify that. #spooky \n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terry_Lester?wprov=sfti1#\n\nhttps://www.institutmontaigne.org/en/expressions/palestine-macrons-2003-moment\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Huachuca?wprov=sfti1","tags":[["e","f575a0d88022be414a7d2147434f85510e56a82376a7b1fa7bbddf03b0c47ff9","wss://no.str.cr","root","1ea4ae8405ad5c6bd0dc35a0ac83e548c485142538e1e0c54ad40e5bb59a2ae8"],["e","d480e0dd470fffb47e145b5a64c2ff5db846f3910b9283e2d6ad1c03906aba68","wss://relay.momostr.pink","reply","1ea4ae8405ad5c6bd0dc35a0ac83e548c485142538e1e0c54ad40e5bb59a2ae8"],["t","spooky"],["r","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terry_Lester?wprov=sfti1#"],["r","https://www.institutmontaigne.org/en/expressions/palestine-macrons-2003-moment"],["r","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Huachuca?wprov=sfti1"],["client","Damus"]]}
