{"id":"00000ae1a931e5fbdccec7a0adcb924b14a87ca703d16feac80d4070abc34525","pubkey":"010df0c948fe9ab54d2cb7ea420ffa08d57958981b6ea68e83aaa7eb2dd3f05a","created_at":1782768307,"content":"Job done.\n\nBefore\n\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/5dc61832ee20b342c2373f3bc2b8d93f05c92728786de43e5f04879a21722230.jpg\n\nAfter\n\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/026827a6405fde999f92cd99a8c6a6e1e01e1c1697d9165cf755aa2452a70ad7.jpg\n\nProof of competent work.\n\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/2b41012b83caa4ae2c7223918c07561ee2682f3d0fd3500d2af5b0508de98f48.jpg\n\nDon't worry, I labeled the breaker and the outlet. I didn't quit mining I just relocated the miner. I have something else I plan to put there now that runs on 110v.\nnostr:nevent1qqsqqqqw9mlcmm6nzkf8aal9asvczxg78ajtx5c2cpjtvvtwltjhn9cpzpmhxue69uhkummnw3ezuamfdejsygqpphcvjj87n2656t9hafpql7sg64u43xqmd6ngaqa25l4jm5lstgmq6kyf","tags":[["q","00000e2eff8def5315927ef7e5ec1981191e3f64b3530ac064b6316efae57997","wss://nostr.wine"],["p","010df0c948fe9ab54d2cb7ea420ffa08d57958981b6ea68e83aaa7eb2dd3f05a"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/5dc61832ee20b342c2373f3bc2b8d93f05c92728786de43e5f04879a21722230.jpg","m image/jpeg","thumbhash mSgKDYKGubtGiIhmihilb7KQKwup","dim 1920x1446"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/026827a6405fde999f92cd99a8c6a6e1e01e1c1697d9165cf755aa2452a70ad7.jpg","m image/jpeg","thumbhash oygKHYR/eZlqh4eHh3h4h3CHB4d4","dim 1920x1446"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/2b41012b83caa4ae2c7223918c07561ee2682f3d0fd3500d2af5b0508de98f48.jpg","m image/jpeg","thumbhash T0kGFYava4d7h3d3V2l4eABdA8U1","dim 1920x1446"],["client","Dark Wisp"],["nonce","2142383","20"]]}
{"id":"99cc7e698f2f9d84ccb637169048878792e7a0e3300ffa1f76b726de6cf20ad7","pubkey":"273f8cb9be4ab05446f0fb12fc3d8087eaa9a190d7dcddd34ac377cc228fcd4b","created_at":1782768184,"content":"Today is a full moon in Capricorn. And now we're at the halfway point of 2026. \nIn Japan, people mainly perform the summer purification ritual by passing through a ring of reeds at Shinto shrines.\n\nThis marks a milestone and is a perfect opportunity to celebrate what we've accomplished over the past six months, while also allowing us to re-evaluate the foundations of our daily lives and let go of unnecessary habits and attachments to the past.\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/90feefed8b9acb8662341702c1950b0dfaca50a868facd516f7abf8b949ac9a6.jpg","tags":[["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/90feefed8b9acb8662341702c1950b0dfaca50a868facd516f7abf8b949ac9a6.jpg","m jpeg","dim 959.0x1193.0"]]}
