{"id":"2bb054b16348d0aff29a16b270815a024ddbcb8e824868c3a6f5f25577e9c678","pubkey":"7cc328a08ddb2afdf9f9be77beff4c83489ff979721827d628a542f32a247c0e","created_at":1782705972,"content":"I sent @ainsleycastello 20$ zap back in the day, bitcoin was only 20k. I did it because I enjoyed the live nostr event.  I'm sure others did too.  Just cause I enjoyed it then, doesn't mean I am gonna listen all the time, or zap every little thing.  Sure if its live that's one thing. If its just some music stream well I have plenty of that and frankly her music is just not my thing.\n\nSo, when I see people trashing 'bitcoiners' for not enough of what basically amounts to charity its like. OK, I'll make sure I don't waste my SATs on some ungreatful punks then.  You insulted my entire race. nostr:npub1a6c3jcdj23ptzcuflek8a04f4hc2cdkat95pd6n3r8jjrwyzrw0q43lfrr nostr:npub1cj8znuztfqkvq89pl8hceph0svvvqk0qay6nydgk9uyq7fhpfsgsqwrz4u nostr:npub1qny3tkh0acurzla8x3zy4nhrjz5zd8l9sy9jys09umwng00manysew95gx nostr:npub1lrnvvs6z78s9yjqxxr38uyqkmn34lsaxznnqgd877j4z2qej3j5s09qnw5 who else? From here on out, I am making a listee.\n\nhttps://image.nostr.build/03ab23893c075fc4256051154c9fc4b62a11e3b4f307fada4288810dff438270.png","tags":[["p","eeb11961b25442b16389fe6c7ebea9adf0ac36dd596816ea7119e521b8821b9e"],["p","c48e29f04b482cc01ca1f9ef8c86ef8318c059e0e9353235162f080f26e14c11"],["p","04c915daefee38317fa734444acee390a8269fe5810b2241e5e6dd343dfbecc9"],["p","f8e6c64342f1e052480630e27e1016dce35fc3a614e60434fef4aa2503328ca9"],["client","RelayTools-android"]]}
