{"id":"9eadfb87b18ee37bc33a47d45239bb8facb982d2734e13a23982d9af275c2737","pubkey":"19f9afb8f855f5e86b5bea160e78ec5871648b10dedb043f4806fca8ce50e4d3","created_at":1782704988,"content":"#rupertsbackyardtoday is a trip down the bayou with Papa Damnit and nostr:nprofile1qqsrg8d45l36jv05jz2as2j2ejfee79xw2fmreqhnl2ttsz5f38u9mcprfmhxue69uhk2mrfw3jhxtnwdaehgunpw35jummjvuhszyrhwden5te0dehhxarj9ekk7mf0qy88wumn8ghj7mn0wvhxcmmv9uqrga6f before we headed back home.\n\nhttps://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/902e2383a5339a044a2d46fe424e15afa6466879c9454c9eebee32b234d4d736.gif\n\nViews from Papa Damnit's houseboat.\nhttps://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/0f939a072ee6956aafa3158e34fe5743b47a901f4c35d13da07f89b39a5bc1f8.jpg\n\nSo. Many. Spiders. \nhttps://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/d3381cb36a87eaec5dfad77d4e6c9df57f8ec510d74220d4e9dcf78a1a4f71f4.jpg\nhttps://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/96092d84807a9ae38ef7d432177590b988cfa320b8c5c178436ef51f14c6734a.jpg https://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/009ff4e01304bde5d695bbb2a1d0dbdcdc54ae1893159b594f88780f2bdd546d.jpg\n\nCarpenter bee hard at work. No one hired him though. \nhttps://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/0bf7cc2f701c5d9ce273aa565a0876d6bd6005bbdd8f797a4f54ab2a611ef971.jpg\n\nButtonbushes... \nhttps://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/76aa0ab90f6a051a3ea9d798ca0bbd33caa0e72a37456e05139bea839770a1ab.jpg\n\nBarges...\nhttps://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/26602e0d2776ddcd608a6e1e4940b288919b7b38992c14a6af4b767acacb5d15.jpg\n\n And big, badass mamas. (Yeah, another spider.) This big girl rode all the way out to the houseboat and back with is and we never knew. Dedicated mama. \nhttps://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/b518b3768fdd45ebb09e7ec5d32f9c7aa0e89683eb8eb19d76e0b90f1164dff9.jpg\n\nI risked life and limb to get these shots for y'all. I was attacked by yellow jackets. Two stings on my right calf and I almost fell into the bayou. ","tags":[["alt","A short note: #rupertsbackyardtoday is a trip down the bayou wit..."],["p","341db5a7e3a931f49095d82a4acc939cf8a67293b1e4179fd4b5c0544c4fc2ef","wss://elites.nostrati.org/"],["p","19f9afb8f855f5e86b5bea160e78ec5871648b10dedb043f4806fca8ce50e4d3"],["t","rupertsbackyardtoday"],["r","https://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/902e2383a5339a044a2d46fe424e15afa6466879c9454c9eebee32b234d4d736.gif"],["r","https://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/96092d84807a9ae38ef7d432177590b988cfa320b8c5c178436ef51f14c6734a.jpg"],["r","https://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/009ff4e01304bde5d695bbb2a1d0dbdcdc54ae1893159b594f88780f2bdd546d.jpg"],["r","https://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/b518b3768fdd45ebb09e7ec5d32f9c7aa0e89683eb8eb19d76e0b90f1164dff9.jpg"],["r","https://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/26602e0d2776ddcd608a6e1e4940b288919b7b38992c14a6af4b767acacb5d15.jpg"],["r","https://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/0bf7cc2f701c5d9ce273aa565a0876d6bd6005bbdd8f797a4f54ab2a611ef971.jpg"],["r","https://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/0f939a072ee6956aafa3158e34fe5743b47a901f4c35d13da07f89b39a5bc1f8.jpg"],["r","https://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/d3381cb36a87eaec5dfad77d4e6c9df57f8ec510d74220d4e9dcf78a1a4f71f4.jpg"],["r","https://npub1r8u6lw8c2h67s66magtqu78vtpckfzcsmmdsg06gqm723njsunfs8kfjwl.blossom.band/76aa0ab90